{"id":"bbc032dc63b4bea2","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds.md","title":"Sensitivity and Block Sensitivity Lower Bound Queries","display":"lem-sensitivity-query-bounds — Sensitivity and Block Sensitivity Lower Bound Queries","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds","aliases":["28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds"],"display":"lem-sensitivity-query-bounds — Sensitivity and Block Sensitivity Lower Bound Queries","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]","[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]","[[28-df-decision-tree]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 12.11","source_printed_pages":"266","source_pdf_pages":"292","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-sensitivity-query-bounds — Sensitivity and Block Sensitivity Lower Bound Queries"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cff47baaf3aae6af\" href=\"?note=cff47baaf3aae6af\" title=\"28-df-boolean-sensitivity\">28-df-boolean-sensitivity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa724d0d8b6348dc\" href=\"?note=aa724d0d8b6348dc\" title=\"28-df-block-sensitivity\">28-df-block-sensitivity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4526464ba7e934ba\" href=\"?note=4526464ba7e934ba\" title=\"28-df-decision-tree\">28-df-decision-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 12.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"266"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"292"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(f),bs(f)\">\\(s(f),bs(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cff47baaf3aae6af\" href=\"?note=cff47baaf3aae6af\" title=\"28-df-boolean-sensitivity\">28-df-boolean-sensitivity</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa724d0d8b6348dc\" href=\"?note=aa724d0d8b6348dc\" title=\"28-df-block-sensitivity\">28-df-block-sensitivity</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\">\\(D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4526464ba7e934ba\" href=\"?note=4526464ba7e934ba\" title=\"28-df-decision-tree\">28-df-decision-tree</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s(f)\\le bs(f)\\le D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s(f)\\le bs(f)\\le D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>敏感坐标的单点块两两不交，给第一界。在达到bs(f)的x上，任何正确树必须查询每个敏感块至少一个位置，否则x和只翻转该块的输入经过同一路径却函数值相反。故最坏路径查询数至少块数。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 12.11；印刷页 266；PDF 页 292。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第12章的 Sensitivity and Block Sensitivity Lower Bound Queries，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypot