_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"s(f)\\le bs(f)\\le D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1630,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-335","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-zero-error-query-complexity]]、[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]、[[28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds]]、[[28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound]]、[[28-df-multilinear-degree]]、[[28-lem-degree-query-lower-bound]]、[[28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds]]。"}],"outgoing":["cff47baaf3aae6af","aa724d0d8b6348dc","4526464ba7e934ba"]}